'Eat here or take away?' Know your answer in Japanese before the cashier asks 🥐
Two phrases, one easy order.

Today's phrases:
• ふたつ (futatsu) = Two (things)
• ここで たべます (koko de tabemasu) = I'll eat here
• もちかえり (mochikaeri) = Takeout

